    "Cube row | 2 cubes placed side-by-side on left half of table | 8 cubes in a contiguous row spanning ~85% of table width | grows incrementally with 6 additional cubes added to the right end by the hand; leftmost two cubes are shifted left by the hand in the final seconds"
